      47.85,
      365.77,
      539.93,
      389.92
    ],
    "text": "REGULATIONS made by the Minister of Transport under Section 237 of the Motor Traffic Act, (Chapter 203), read withSections 112A, 124, 125 and 126 of the aforesaid Act.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      47.85,
      404.77,
      530.86,
      454.84
    ],
    "text": "Minister of Transport and Civil Aviation.Colombo,07th December, 2015.Regulations",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      47.85,
      469.81,
      539.86,
      506.56
    ],
    "text": "The Motor Traffic (Reward and Incentive Fund) Regulations, No. 4 of 2011 published in the Gazette ExtraordinaryNo. 1726/12 of October 5, 2011 are hereby amended by the repeal of the regulation 2(1) thereof and the substitution of thefollowing:-",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      107.85,
      521.05,
      539.9,
      557.8
    ],
    "text": "\u201c2.(1) The Reward and Incentive Fund established under section 213D of the Motor Traffic Act(Chapter 203) (hereinafter referred to as the \u2018Act\u2019) shall be managed and administered by the Governing Boardconsisting of:-",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      171.57,
      563.29,
      539.89,
      585.4
    ],
    "text": "(a)the Commissioner General of Motor Traffic, who shall be the Chairman of the GoverningBoard;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      171.57,
      596.29,
      401.15,
      607.36
    ],
    "text": "(b)the Commissioner of Motor Traffic (Administration);",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      172.29,
      618.25,
      439.3,
      629.32
    ],
    "text": "(c)the Chief Financial Officer of the Department of Motor Traffic;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      171.57,
      640.33,
      539.89,
      662.32
    ],
    "text": "(d)a representative of the Ministry of the Transport nominated by the Secretary to theMinistry of the Minister to whom the subject of Transport has been assigned; and",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
